   Port of Antwerp-Bruges/Port of Antwerp-Bruges/Detail
   Detail Updates Leaderboard
   Description

   The Antwerp-Bruges Port Authority has a key role in the port's day-to-day
   operation. The Port Authority manages and maintains the docks, the
   bridges, the locks, the quay walls and the land. The personnel is also
   responsible for safe shipping traffic in the docks, the bridges and locks.
   In addition, the Port Authority provides tugs and cranes, carries out
   dredging work and promotes the port at home and abroad.

